Skill Creator portable distribution

Based on the OpenAI-bundled Codex Skill Creator supplied with the local environment.
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is preserved in license.txt and applies to this directory.
Local distribution changes: explicit UTF-8 reads/writes in helper scripts; reject empty name/description in the validator; preflight invalid initializer UI arguments before creating a partial directory; refreshed UI metadata; added packaging documentation and regression tests. Decorative bundled icon assets are omitted.
The managed system installation is not replaced by this repository copy.
